      {
        "finding": "Only 17 of 141 low-frequency latents reached intruder accuracy ≥0.5. Accuracy tracks amino-acid purity (ρ=0.52), and only 1 of 111 low-precision latents passed.",
        "proposed_claim": "Most low-frequency SAE latents in a protein structure model are not judged coherent by blind intruder detection; coherent ones are mostly single-residue detectors.",
